---
// The site's <head> on every catalog page, inside scaffolding's: noindex and data-hw-night as the
// site's own <html> carries them (src/layouts/Layout.astro). The shell leaves data-hw-night off a
// state drawn alone while its theme still turns, so without it a dark theme drew dark elements on
// the light ground.
---

<meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-hw-night", "");
</script>
